#: TopWidget.cpp:261
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes.\n"
"Are you sure you want to quit?"
msgstr ""
"Hai cambios sen gardar.\n"
"¿Está seguro de que quere saír?"

#: TopWidget.cpp:263
msgid "Yes, quit!"
msgstr "Sí, sair!"

#: TopWidget.cpp:264
msgid "No, don't quit."
msgstr "Non, non saír."

#: TopWidget.cpp:292
msgid "Clear Changes"
msgstr "Limpar Cambios"

#: TopWidget.cpp:293
msgid "Do you really want to clear all unsaved changes?"
msgstr "¿Desexa realmente limpar tódolos cambios sen gardar?"

#: TopWidget.cpp:307
msgid "Save configuration"
msgstr "Gardar Configuración"

#: TopWidget.cpp:308
msgid ""
"You're about to save the changes made to your init configuration.\n"
"Please realize that wrong settings could result in your system being "
"unbootable.\n"
"\n"
"Do you wish to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Está a punto de garda-los cambios realizados da súa configuración\n"
"de inicio. Por favor, decátese de que una configuración incorrecta\n"
"podería facer que o seu sistema non arrinque.\n"
"\n"
"¿Desexa continuar?"

#: TopWidget.cpp:313
msgid "Yes, &save!"
msgstr "Sí, &gardar!"

#: TopWidget.cpp:314
msgid "No, &don't save."
msgstr "Non, non gar&dar."

